          "claimId": "20674cd1-62d7-5233-9362-d25d1d7fa536",
          "sourceId": "e8879b9c-7a15-5b62-88a3-8d3642666674",
          "quote": "Received: January 19, 2012; Accepted: September 24, 2012; Published: October 24, 2012",
          "locator": "article information",
          "context": null,
          "evidence": "QUOTED",
          "level": "PROVISIONAL"
        },
        {
          "id": "aa11c908-c43e-5a8c-aa9f-222f055a2284",
          "claimId": "20674cd1-62d7-5233-9362-d25d1d7fa536",
          "sourceId": "e8879b9c-7a15-5b62-88a3-8d3642666674",
          "quote": "While the records of Central Leather Research Institute, India showed only 170 tanneries at Kanpur, a study conducted in 2000 found twice this number in just one tanning cluster",
